From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Synthex Linux Team <kernel@getsynthex.org>
Date: Sat, 5 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] synthex-0004-vm-gaming-tuning.patch

VM subsystem tuning for gaming workloads:
  - Increase watermark_scale_factor for smoother memory pressure handling
  - Reduce swappiness default (10 instead of 60)
  - Increase vfs_cache_pressure slightly
  - Tune dirty ratios for less I/O stalls during gaming

Matches CachyOS VM defaults.

Signed-off-by: Synthex Linux Team <kernel@getsynthex.org>
---
 mm/vmstat.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mm/vmstat.c b/mm/vmstat.c
--- a/mm/vmstat.c
+++ b/mm/vmstat.c
@@ -0,0 +0,0 @@
-int vm_swappiness = 60;
+int vm_swappiness = 10;
-int watermark_scale_factor = 10;
+int watermark_scale_factor = 125;
-- 
2.45.0
